II. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION
We use your information to provide, maintain, and improve our Products and Services, to research and develop new products and features, and to promote our Products and Services, as further explained below.
A. To Provide the Life360 Products and Services
We may use information about you to:
Provide the Products and Services to you or other members, including to record the location and movements of you and your devices linked to our Services or to broadcast (sending and receiving) Escaped Pet Mode alerts to your Circle and Lost Pet Alerts to the Pet Finder Network;
Manage your account with us, including authenticating access, verifying identity, and keeping track of your preferences and choices;
Personalize your experience on our Services;
Ensure the integrity and security, and perform internal quality control and optimization of our Products and Services;
Communicate with you about your account;
As stated here, for informational, transactional, marketing and operational purposes, such as account management, customer service, system maintenance, to administer promotional sweepstakes or contests or to remind about items you browsed or left in your shopping cart;
To process applications, transactions, and payments;
To prevent potentially prohibited, harmful, or illegal activities, including to detect or prevent fraud;
To share your information and/or location with others for certain purposes, such as temporary location sharing or enabling members to connect with you to find their Tiles/Pet Tags/Pet GPS or lost pet;
Provide technical support and repair errors or bugs in our Services; and
To enforce our Terms of Service and this Privacy Policy and comply with our legal requirements.
B. Marketing Life360 Products and Services
Life360 may use your information for marketing purposes such as to send you emails, text messages, mobile, watch or push notifications, or postal mailings, as allowed by applicable law, with personalized information about Life360’s or our business partners’ products and services including special offers or features that may be of interest to you. Note: Some jurisdictions may require your consent prior to receiving promotional messages. You can opt out of these communications at any time,
see
below
for details.
We may also use the information we collect to understand the effectiveness of our marketing campaigns. With your permission, we may also use information you provide in response to surveys about your experience with our product or services in our marketing materials.
This section does not apply to Employee Benefit Program Members.
C. Research and Development
We may use information we collect in order to:
Understand how users engage with our Products and Services, including to monitor which features are popular, metrics, and trends or to contact you to learn more about your experiences;
Conduct individual or market research and analytics;
Help us to optimally deliver our existing Products and Services;
To develop new products and services; and
For research and internal analysis.
D. Connecting with Social Media
When you choose to connect or interact with our Services through a Social Network, or if you use social features, the information provided to Life360 via those Social Networks or social features may be used to verify information that you have independently provided to Life360 and to enhance our ability to provide you with information about our business, products, and Services.

