Certain information we process is considered "sensitive" under State Privacy Laws, such as precise geolocation data, personal information of children, and, if you select to use certain features within our Products and Services, such as emergency assistance, you may provide us information about health conditions and your race, or ethnicity. We process such sensitive information only with your consent, or, in the case of children, with the consent of the child's parent or legal guardian.
As described in the
Information We Collect
section above, we collect personal information from various sources, including directly from you, automatically when you use or interact with our Products or Services, and from third-party sources.
We retain personal information as described in the
Data Retention
subsection above. We maintain and use de-identified information only in a de-identified fashion, and will not attempt to re-identify such information, except as permitted by law.
Life360 Loyalty Program: Financial Incentive Notice
Life360 offers a loyalty program in which you can earn points, called “Swircles,” by taking certain actions in the Life360 app, including sharing your location, having your driving behavior tracked, creating a Circle, and (for account holders 18 and older) opting in to marketing emails and text messages. You can redeem Swircles for rewards Life360 makes available from time to time.
Because Swircles are earned through actions that involve the collection of your personal information, this Program is a financial incentive under the California Consumer Privacy Act.
Material terms:
You earn Swircles by completing eligible actions in the app. Swircles have no cash value and cannot be sold or transferred. The current reward requires 500 Swircles, redeemable for your choice of either a $10 discount code toward Tile devices or one month of Life360 Gold membership. Full program terms are available at [link to Program Terms]. See also the published Trial Offer Terms and Conditions (to be updated with the same name change).
How to opt in:
You are automatically enrolled if you are eligible to participate; no separate sign-up is required.
